    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "liberating? it doesnt feel liberating. it feels like i'm just drifting through a life that doesnt belong to me anymore. i look in the mirror and i dont see a person, i just see the space where he used to be. like how am i supposed to find a \"self\" when everything that made me \"me\" was tied to him? it just feels like there's nothing left to find.",
