      "content": "You are right to feel lost, but the void you see is actually the only place where you can truly start again without the weight of his expectations. Since the old identity was built on someone else, the only way to find your self is to let go of the ghost and embrace the silence. It is not a tragedy to be empty; it is a necessary space for the new you to finally breathe.",
